      "block_id": "s1:block:02893-02894",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "おはよう",
      "en": "Good morning."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02900-02901",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Shuri",
      "jp": "御主人様、どうぞ此方へ",
      "en": "Master, please come this way."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02903-02906",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "シュリが先に立ち椅子を引いて待つ窓際の席には昨日同様に\n白いテーブルカバーの掛けられ、更に其の窓にだけレースの\nカーテンが付けられ、この食堂には似つかわしくない\n雰囲気を醸し出している",
      "en": "Shuri went ahead and pulled out a chair at the window-side seat. Like yesterday, a white tablecloth covered it, and lace curtains hung only at that window, lending an atmosphere out of place in this dining hall."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02908-02909",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "……",
      "en": "..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02911-02911",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "まあ、予想し得なかった事ではない",
      "en": "Well, it wasn't unexpected."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02917-02918",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Rinsha",
      "jp": "ほらほら、何ぼーっとしているの",
      "en": "Hey, what's with the daydreaming?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02920-02931",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "笑みを浮かべたリンシャに背を押されて其の席に着くと\n直ぐにシュリが朝食を持ってくる\n焼きたてのパンと薄味のスープにサラダ、簡単な、\nそれでいて俺が最も好む朝食のメニューが並べられる\nあまり目立つのは好ましくはないが、この旅にシュリの\n同行を許した時点で予想された事だ\n俺は大人しくシュリの給仕を受けて朝食を済ませると、\n食器を片づけるシュリを見ながら食後の紅茶をゆっくりと\n口に運んだ……",
      "en": "Pushed by the smiling Rinsha, I take my seat. Immediately Shuri brings breakfast. Freshly baked bread, a light soup, and salad — a simple menu, yet my favorite breakfast is laid out. I would prefer not to stand out, but this was expected ever since I allowed Shuri to accompany me on this journey. I quietly accept Shuri's service and finish eating, then, watching Shuri clear the dishes, I slowly sip my after-meal tea..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02940-02943",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "バタンッ\n突然大きな音を立てて入り口の扉が開き、\n男が食堂の中に倒れ込んできた。",
      "en": "Bam! The entrance door burst open, and a man tumbled into the dining hall."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02951-02952",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Rinsha",
      "jp": "ランドさん！",
      "en": "Rando!"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02954-02954",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "倒れた男・ランドにリンシャが駆け寄る。",
      "en": "Rinsha rushed over to the fallen man, Rando."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02956-02957",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Rando",
      "jp": "うう……",
      "en": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02959-02960",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Rinsha",
      "jp": "リシカ！　司祭様を呼んで来て！",
      "en": "Rishika! Go fetch the priest!"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02962-02965",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "リシカ\nは、はいっ\nリンシャに言われて、給仕の娘が外に駆け出していく。",
      "en": "Rishika\nY-yes!\nAt Rinsha's bidding, the serving girl dashes outside."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02967-02968",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Rinsha",
      "jp": "セリカ！",
      "en": "Celica!"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02970-02971",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "判っている",
      "en": "I know."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02973-02976",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "俺はリンシャに言われる迄もなく戸口に倒れている\nランドの体を抱えると食堂の中央の床に寝かせた｡\n見るとランドの背中には刃物で切られた傷があり、\nかなりの重傷のようだ｡",
      "en": "Even before Rinsha could say anything, I lifted Rando's body from the doorway and laid him on the dining hall floor. On his back was a blade wound, and it seemed quite serious."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02978-02979",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "シュリ",
      "en": "Shuri"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02985-02987",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Shuri",
      "jp": "はい！\nリンシャさん私に診せて下さい",
      "en": "Yes!\nRinsha, please let me examine him."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02993-02994",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Rinsha",
      "jp": "シュリちゃん？",
      "en": "Shuri?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03000-03012",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "リンシャに声を掛けてランドの傍らに跪いたシュリは、\nランドの体に向かって掌を翳す。\n神の肉体を持つ俺とシュリは主従関係の他に、\n主と使徒という関係にある。\n使徒とは神もしくはそれに準ずる者から様々な能力を\n与えられる代わりにその者に絶対服従を誓った者達の総称で、\nシュリは自らの意志で俺の使徒となる事を望み、\n俺が分け与えた力で癒しの魔法を使う事が出来る。\nもっとも、力を授けた俺が本来の力を失っている以上、\nシュリも余り大きな力は使えないのだが……",
      "en": "After calling to Rinsha, Shuri knelt beside Rando and held her palm over his body. She and I, who possess divine bodies, share not only a master-servant relationship but also that of lord and apostle. An apostle is one who pledges absolute obedience to a god or a similar being, receiving various abilities in return. Shuri chose to become my apostle by her own will, and with the power I granted her, she can use healing magic. However, since I, who granted that power, have lost my original strength, Shuri cannot use great power either..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03018-03019",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Rando",
      "jp": "う……",
      "en": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03021-03023",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "シュリの癒しの力は傷自体には余り効果を\n及ぼさなかった様だが、ランドに意識を取り戻させる事が\n出来たらしい。",
      "en": "Shuri's healing magic didn't seem to do much for the wound itself, but it apparently managed to bring Rando around."
    }
  ]
}

